Description: Rust-owned Asterisk radio controller for USBRadioPlus
 A controller module for USBRadioPlus RadioPlusAdvanced channels. It installs
 only the Asterisk metadata shim and versioned Rust adapter objects; it ships no
 static controller archive or legacy controller headers.

